    "target_floor_px": 44,
    "no_color_only_meaning": true,
    "out_of_scope": [
      "WCAG 2.2 AAA",
      "external-body-certification"
    ],
    "scope_statement": "WCAG 2.2 AA contrast (4.5:1 body text, 3:1 large text and UI boundaries/focus), 44x44 px touch target floor with declared hit-area padding exceptions, and no color-only meaning; WCAG 2.2 AAA and external body certification are explicitly out of scope."
  },
